+        <div class="hero-copy"><div class="hero-tag"><span class="status-dot"></span>日常使用 · 轻松上手</div><h1 id="hero-title">安心回家，<br>从这里开始。</h1><p class="hero-intro measure-prose">从第一次录入指纹，到日常更换电池，<br class="desktop-break">三件常用操作，一步一步带你完成。</p><a href="#fingerprint" class="primary-link">开始阅读 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="hero-caption">操作前，请先保持门扇打开。</p></div>
+        <div class="hero-art">
+          <svg class="lock-illustration" viewBox="0 0 350 370" role="img" aria-labelledby="lock-title lock-desc"><title id="lock-title">智能门锁外面板示意图</title><desc id="lock-desc">门锁包含数字键盘、把手与指纹识别区。实际布局因型号而异。</desc>
+            <defs><linearGradient id="lock-body" x1="0" x2="1"><stop stop-color="#252d29"/><stop offset=".45" stop-color="#424b44"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#242c28"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="handle" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#697168"/><stop offset=".45" stop-color="#3b443e"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#222b25"/></linearGradient><filter id="shadow" x="-60%" width="250%" y="-20%" height="150%"><feDropShadow dx="7" dy="13" stdDeviation="10" flood-color="#1b3024" flood-opacity=".18"/></filter></defs>
+            <circle cx="186" cy="184" r="139" fill="#e3e8d7"/><circle cx="186" cy="184" r="112" fill="none" stroke="#cbd5be" stroke-dasharray="3 7"/>
+            <g filter="url(#shadow)"><rect x="144" y="26" width="92" height="308" rx="27" fill="url(#lock-body)"/><rect x="151" y="32" width="77" height="295" rx="22" fill="none" stroke="#7f897a" stroke-opacity=".32"/><rect x="158" y="47" width="64" height="135" rx="17" fill="#202923"/><rect x="180" y="57" width="20" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="#b8d297"/>
+            <g fill="#dae1d1" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" font-family="system-ui, sans-serif"><text x="172" y="86">1</text><text x="190" y="86">2</text><text x="208" y="86">3</text><text x="172" y="111">4</text><text x="190" y="111">5</text><text x="208" y="111">6</text><text x="172" y="136">7</text><text x="190" y="136">8</text><text x="208" y="136">9</text><text x="172" y="161">*</text><text x="190" y="161">0</text><text x="208" y="161">#</text></g>
+            <rect x="170" y="198" width="139" height="35" rx="17.5" fill="url(#handle)" stroke="#75816e" stroke-width=".6"/><circle cx="188" cy="215" r="14" fill="#19251c" stroke="#94a381"/>
+            <g fill="none" stroke="#c1d2aa" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M181 217v-4a7 7 0 0 1 14 0v4M184 221v-8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v9M188 211v13M178 213v5"/></g><rect x="183" y="286" width="14" height="4" rx="2" fill="#151d17"/></g>
+            <g fill="none" stroke="#89987c"><path d="M158 112H82l-14-14H35"/><circle cx="158" cy="112" r="3" fill="#e9eedf"/><path d="M175 216H92l-14 20H35"/><circle cx="175" cy="216" r="3" fill="#e9eedf"/></g><g fill="#526149" font-size="12" font-family="system-ui, sans-serif"><text x="35" y="88">数字键盘</text><text x="35" y="258">指纹识别区</text></g>
+          </svg><p class="illustration-caption">外面板示意 · 实际结构以产品为准</p>
+        </div>
+      </section>
+
+      <div class="preflight"><span class="info-symbol" aria-hidden="true">i</span><div><strong>先准备好，再开始</strong><p>保持门扇打开，准备管理员验证方式，并将机械钥匙放在随手可取的位置。操作完成后，先在开门状态下测试，再关门使用。</p></div></div>
+
+      <section class="guide-section" id="fingerprint" aria-labelledby="fingerprint-title">
+        <div class="section-heading"><div class="heading-main"><span class="section-number">01</span><div><p class="section-kicker">首次使用 / 添加新成员</p><h2 id="fingerprint-title">录入指纹</h2></div></div><span class="section-badge">需要管理员验证</span></div>
+        <p class="section-intro measure-prose">用经常开门的手指录入，让识别更自然。开始前，擦净识别区，并保持手指清洁、干燥。</p>
+        <ol class="steps">
+          <li><span class="step-number">1</span><div><h3>进入管理菜单</h3><p>唤醒门锁，按本机说明进入设置菜单，使用管理员密码、指纹或其他已配置方式完成验证。</p></div></li>
+          <li><span class="step-number">2</span><div><h3>选择添加指纹</h3><p>找到“用户管理”或类似菜单，选择“添加用户”中的“指纹”。日常家庭成员可选择普通用户权限。</p></div></li>
+          <li><span class="step-number">3</span><div><h3>多角度采集同一根手指</h3><p>将指腹轻放在识别区，按提示抬起再放下，稍微调整角度，覆盖指腹中心和边缘。重复至门锁提示录入成功。</p></div></li>
+          <li><span class="step-number">4</span><div><h3>退出菜单，测试解锁</h3><p>保持门扇打开，用新录入的指纹测试解锁。确认能稳定识别后，再正常关门。</p></div></li>
+        </ol>
+        <div class="tip"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span><p><strong>录入小技巧</strong>　可以为同一位家人再录入另一根常用手指，作为备用。采集过程中不要一直按住，也不要换手指。</p></div>
+      </section>
+
+      <section class="guide-section" id="battery" aria-labelledby="battery-title">
+        <div class="section-heading"><div class="heading-main"><span class="section-number">02</span><div><p class="section-kicker">日常维护 / 低电量提醒</p><h2 id="battery-title">更换电池</h2></div></div><span class="section-badge">先确认供电类型</span></div>
+        <p class="section-intro measure-prose">听到低电量提示后，请及时处理。电池仓通常位于室内面板，打开方式以产品标识为准。</p>
+        <div class="battery-types"><div><span class="small-label">干电池机型</span><h3>整组换新，同型号使用</h3><p>按电池仓标识准备指定规格、数量与类型的电池，不混用新旧电池或不同类型电池。</p></div><div><span class="small-label">专用锂电池机型</span><h3>使用配套电池与充电设备</h3><p>按说明书取出充电或更换原厂指定电池组，不要用普通干电池替代，也不要自行拆解电池组。</p></div></div>
+        <ol class="steps">
+          <li><span class="step-number">1</span><div><h3>打开室内电池仓</h3><p>保持门扇打开，按标识滑动或取下电池盖；如有固定螺丝，使用合适工具拆卸，不要强行撬开。</p></div></li>
+          <li><span class="step-number">2</span><div><h3>取出旧电池，装入新电池</h3><p>干电池需整组取出，并按正负极标识装入新电池。专用电池组按说明连接，确认接头牢固，避免夹住线缆。</p></div></li>
+          <li><span class="step-number">3</span><div><h3>装回仓盖，检查运行</h3><p>等待门锁启动，确认低电量提醒消失，并在开门状态下测试解锁、上锁。旧电池请按当地要求分类回收。</p></div></li>
+        </ol>
+        <div class="tip"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span><p><strong>已经完全没电？</strong>　先使用机械钥匙；如机型支持应急供电，可按说明连接指定电源。应急供电接口不一定能给内部电池充电。</p></div>
+      </section>
+
+      <section class="guide-section reset-section" id="reset" aria-labelledby="reset-title">
+        <div class="section-heading"><div class="heading-main"><span class="section-number">03</span><div><p class="section-kicker">重新配置 / 交接设备</p><h2 id="reset-title">恢复出厂设置</h2></div></div><span class="section-badge warning-badge">谨慎操作</span></div>
+        <div class="warning"><span class="warning-icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span><div><h3>此操作可能清除全部开锁凭证</h3><p>包括指纹、密码、门卡与个性化设置，清除后通常无法恢复。仅在确有需要且有管理权限时操作；普通识别失败可先参考下方常见问题。</p></div></div>
+        <ol class="steps">
+          <li><span class="step-number">1</span><div><h3>确认型号，做好重新配置准备</h3><p>找到本机说明书，确认重置方法与数据清除范围。确保供电充足、门扇打开，机械钥匙可用，并准备重新添加管理员。</p></div></li>
+          <li><span class="step-number">2</span><div><h3>按本机说明执行重置</h3><p>有的机型通过管理员菜单重置，有的使用室内面板重置键。按说明完成验证与确认；按键位置、长按时长因型号而异，请勿尝试通用按键组合。</p></div></li>
+          <li><span class="step-number">3</span><div><h3>等待完成，重新设置管理员</h3><p>重置期间不要断电。听到完成提示后，立即创建新的管理员凭证，再录入家庭成员的指纹、密码或门卡。</p></div></li>
+          <li><span class="step-number">4</span><div><h3>检查绑定状态，完整测试</h3><p>联网机型按说明重新配网；恢复出厂设置不一定解除云端账户绑定，交接设备时还需按品牌流程解绑。完成后在开门状态下测试开锁与上锁，再关门使用。</p></div></li>
+        </ol>
+      </section>
+
+      <section class="faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="faq-heading"><h2 id="faq-title">你可能还想知道</h2><span>常见问题</span></div>
+        <details><summary>指纹总是识别失败，怎么办？<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>先用柔软干布清洁识别区，擦干手指，再调整指腹位置尝试。手指脱皮或受伤时，可使用备用指纹或密码。若反复失败，重新录入该指纹；仍无法解决时，联系品牌售后。</p></details>
+        <details><summary>换电池后，需要重新录入指纹吗？<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>多数机型正常更换电池不会清除已保存的用户信息，具体以说明书为准。更换时不要按重置键；如换电后仍无响应，请检查电池规格、正负极与电池组连接。</p></details>
+        <details><summary>忘记管理员密码，可以直接重置吗？<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>请先查看本机说明书中的账户找回或重置流程；部分机型需要管理员验证或品牌售后协助。联系售后时准备型号及购买凭证，不要反复尝试不明按键组合。</p></details>
+      </section>
+      <footer><span class="footer-mark">安居 · 使用指南</span><p>妥善保管机械钥匙，建议在门外留有可靠的备用取用方式。</p><a href="#top">回到顶部 ↑</a></footer>
+    </main>
+  </div>
+  <script>
+    const links = [...document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item')];
+    const sections = links.map(link => document.querySelector(link.getAttribute('href')));
+    let scheduled = false;
+    function updateNavigation() {
+      let current = sections[0];
+      sections.forEach(section => { if (section.getBoundingClientRect().top <= 160) current = section; });
+      if (window.scrollY + window.innerHeight >= document.documentElement.scrollHeight - 5) current = sections[sections.length - 1];
+      links.forEach(link => {
+        const active = link.getAttribute('href') === '#' + current.id;
+        link.classList.toggle('active', active);
+        if (active) link.setAttribute('aria-current', 'location'); else link.removeAttribute('aria-current');
+      });
+      scheduled = false;
+    }
+    window.addEventListener('scroll', () => { if (!scheduled) { scheduled = true; requestAnimationFrame(updateNavigation); } }, { passive: true });
+    window.addEventListener('resize', updateNavigation);
+    updateNavigation();
+    let detailStates;
+    window.addEventListener('beforeprint', () => { detailStates = [...document.querySelectorAll('details')].map(detail => [detail, detail.open]); detailStates.forEach(([detail]) => { detail.open = true; }); });
+    window.addEventListener('afterprint', () => { if (detailStates) detailStates.forEach(([detail, open]) => { detail.open = open; }); });
+  </script>
+</body>
+</html>
diff --git a/style.css b/style.css
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..328a1178441aea05f7abe982518cd9848a034359
--- /dev/null
+++ b/style.css
@@ -0,0 +1,31 @@
+@layer measure;
+:root{color-scheme:light;--paper:#fafbf7;--ink:#25372d;--muted:#687365;--line:#e0e5da;--green:#3e563a;--pale:#edf1e5}
+*{box-sizing:border-box}
+html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:104px}
+body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:system-ui,"PingFang SC","Noto Sans SC",sans-serif;font-size:16px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
+a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
+button{font:inherit}
+button,a,summary{-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
+a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #78915e;outline-offset:5px}
+p,h1,h2,h3{margin:0}
+.skip{position:fixed;top:-70px;left:16px;z-index:10;padding:12px;background:white}.skip:focus{top:12px}
+.header{height:84px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 5.2%;background:#fafbf7f5;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;backdrop-filter:blur(12px)}
+.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:23px;font-weight:650}.brand-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--green);width:34px;height:38px;border-radius:10px;color:#f5f8ee}.brand-icon svg{width:21px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6}.brand-divider{height:20px;width:1px;background:#d0d8c9;margin:0 8px}.brand-sub{font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)}
+.print-button{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;background:transparent;border:1px solid #d8dfd0;border-radius:7px;padding:9px 15px;color:#475441;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer}.print-button svg{width:17px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.5}.print-button:hover{background:var(--pale)}
+.layout{max-width:1360px;padding:0 5.2%;margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px minmax(0,1fr);gap:48px}
+.sidebar{border-right:1px solid var(--line);padding-right:28px}.sidebar-inner{position:sticky;top:126px;padding-bottom:30px}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;color:#737f6e;margin-bottom:17px}.eyebrow span{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;margin-left:5px}.sidebar-title{font-size:24px;font-weight:650}.sidebar-description{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}.sidebar nav{display:grid;gap:7px;margin:30px 0 42px}.nav-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;padding:12px;border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;color:#616d5a}.nav-item:hover{background:#f0f3e9}.nav-item.active{background:#e8eedc;color:#334b2d;font-weight:600}.nav-number{font-size:12px;width:20px;color:#76856c;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.nav-arrow{margin-left:auto;font-weight:400}.side-note{font-size:12px;color:#53644b;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:24px}.status-dot{display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#75935b;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:8px}.side-note p{margin-top:10px;color:#788170;font-size:12px}.back-top{display:inline-block;margin-top:30px;font-size:12px;color:#788170}
+main{min-width:0;padding-top:40px}.hero{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr 1fr;align-items:center;min-height:420px;background:#eef2e5;border:1px solid #e3e9d9;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;padding:34px 30px 30px 36px}.hero-tag{font-size:12px;color:#5e704f;margin-bottom:23px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(34px,3.5vw,48px);font-weight:650;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:1px}.hero-intro{font-size:14px;color:#65715c;margin-top:20px;line-height:1.85}.primary-link{display:inline-flex;gap:33px;align-items:center;padding:11px 19px;margin-top:26px;background:#3e563a;color:white;border-radius:6px;font-size:14px}.primary-link:hover{background:#2c4228}.hero-caption{font-size:12px;color:#778269;margin-top:14px}.hero-art{align-self:center;margin-left:-12px}.lock-illustration{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;overflow:visible}.illustration-caption{text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#7c876e;margin-top:-5px}
+.preflight{display:flex;gap:13px;padding:24px 3px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.info-symbol{margin-top:3px;flex-shrink:0;border:1px solid #809276;border-radius:50%;width:19px;height:19px;font-size:12px;text-align:center;line-height:17px;color:#718464}.preflight strong{font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.preflight p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px;max-width:52em}
+.guide-section{padding:40px 0 36px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);scroll-margin-top:10px}.section-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}.heading-main{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}.section-number{font-size:38px;font-weight:350;color:#889c76;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;line-height:1.2}.section-kicker{font-size:12px;color:#7a8571;margin-bottom:5px}h2{font-size:26px;font-weight:650}.section-badge{font-size:12px;color:#617452;background:#edf1e6;border:1px solid #e3e9d8;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:5px;white-space:nowrap}.section-intro{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:22px;line-height:1.8}
+.steps{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:27px 0 24px;display:grid;gap:0}.steps li{display:flex;gap:16px;position:relative;padding-bottom:24px}.steps li:last-child{padding-bottom:0}.steps li:not(:last-child)::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:14px;top:31px;bottom:3px;border-left:1px solid #e0e5d9}.step-number{display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0;width:29px;height:29px;border:1px solid #d8e1cb;border-radius:50%;background:#f1f5e9;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#5d744a}.steps h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin:3px 0 6px}.steps p{font-size:14px;max-width:36em;color:#687262;line-height:1.85}.tip{display:flex;gap:12px;background:#f0f3ea;border-radius:7px;padding:16px 19px}.tip>span{font-size:18px;color:#7d9467}.tip p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:#657358;max-width:48em}.tip strong{font-weight:600;color:#465c3c}
+.battery-types{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:15px;margin-top:23px}.battery-types>div{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:20px;border-radius:8px;background:#fffefa}.small-label{font-size:12px;color:#7f8c70}.battery-types h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin:9px 0}.battery-types p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8}.warning-badge{background:#f7eee1;color:#8b6638;border-color:#ebdcc5}.warning{display:flex;gap:14px;background:#faf1e4;border:1px solid #ecdfc9;padding:19px 20px;border-radius:8px;margin:25px 0}.warning-icon{flex-shrink:0;color:#986a2e;border:1px solid #b99357;border-radius:50%;width:22px;height:22px;text-align:center;font-size:14px}.warning h3{font-size:15px;color:#7c5b2e;margin-bottom:7px;font-weight:600}.warning p{max-width:40em;font-size:14px;color:#8a714e;line-height:1.8}
+.faq{padding:37px 0 34px}.faq-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:20px}.faq h2{font-size:22px}.faq-heading>span{font-size:12px;color:#839078}.faq details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.faq summary{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:19px 0;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;list-style:none}.faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.faq summary span{font-size:20px;font-weight:300;color:#6b7d5b;transition:transform .2s}.faq details[open] summary span{transform:rotate(45deg)}.faq details p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--muted);padding:0 20px 20px 0;max-width:38em}
+footer{padding:25px 0 32px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#7b8571;font-size:12px}.footer-mark{font-weight:600;color:#5a6c4d}footer p{font-size:12px}footer a{margin-left:auto;white-space:nowrap}
+/* Keep explanatory text readable and limit line length across all layouts. */
